Z||000002||Dave Gunsul||09-29-2001||11:05 AM||||Gear ratios are as follows.<P>Getrag:<BR>1st: 3.50<BR>2cond: 2.05<BR>3rd: 1.38<BR>4th: 0.94<BR>5th: 0.72<BR>final drive: 3.61<P>Isuzu:<BR>1st: 3.73<BR>2cond: 2.04<BR>3rd: 1.45<BR>4th: 1.03<BR>5th: 0.74<BR>final drive: 3.35<P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
